  "annotations_dropped": [
    {
      "annotation_id": "363a0ce3c63b430b88a2a2d219f3eec5_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "They have expressed their acquiescence and have no reservations regarding the jurisdictional shift of the case to the CBI from the State agency for further investigation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3337c460d29a4808b2d4f67f1aeb1580_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A writ court, when dealing with police inaction, generally cannot delve into the merits of the case per se."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "195d9a147aeb4b43a4fa427823455367_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Its role is usually limited to assessing whether the police have failed to fulfill their legal duties, such as registering a First Information Report (FIR) or conducting a proper investigation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e68c4de345d349d49186b9cabbfead6f_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAkhtar Ali vs The State Of West Bengal & Ors on 23 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/68121809/\n5 12."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d948eb6f75654982b9a2dddb75dfad22_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In such situation, the court primarily examines procedural compliance and ensures that law enforcement authorities follow the correct process."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "02f366eb9dc04c6792db4a80f20fb3d7_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, the writ court does not serve as a fact-finding body or a trial court that determines the innocence or guilt of the parties involved."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "35a2d978562c4409b4bb1694c318f32d_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nInstead, it addresses administrative failures and orders remedial actions without making judgments on the substantive merits of the criminal matter."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "da39ea1d99ef48898a2fd5ea45733d91_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "13. The same principle has been reiterated by the Supreme Court in M.C. Mehta vs. Union of India and Others reported in (2007) 1 SCC 110, that:\n\"30."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2036b4f774b3473696e6545ce2cbffcd_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "At the outset, we may state that this Court is concerned with ensuring proper and honest performance of its duty by CBI and that this Court is not concerned with the merits of the accusations in investigation, which are to be determined at "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e5f1c4f777604508844cf11e2516f48e_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "14. Accordingly, this Court shall refrain from delving into the substantive merits of the case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e42f656b8210433a9b5039dcaacbde6b_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nNonetheless, a significant issue persists regarding the appropriate investigative authority,\nspecifically whether the inquiry should remain under the purview of the Special Investigation Team (SIT) or be transferred to the jurisdiction of "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9a8212a531c24fde9570d76da8c56fdc_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The determination of this procedural question warrants careful consideration to ensure the proper administration of justice and adherence to due process in the investigation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8cc1f5b9344d467caac91e3387c4235b_70",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "15. It is to be noted that in light of the resurgence of multiple allegations subsequent to the hapless incident at R.G. Kar Medical College on the 9th of August, 2024, an Independent Enquiry by a Special Investigation Team (SIT) was consti"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "29abe2f12cc34496a5c0c2e0619ef376_71",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In light of the apparent nexus between the aforementioned allegations and the locus of the incident, and considering that the investigation in the case of XXXXX (Parents of Victim) Vs. State of West Bengal & Ors. in WPA (P) 339 of 2024 has "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "196b7c86e19a43c58e661afa6f4cb055_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "16. Therefore, this Court directs that the investigation be transferred to the CBI, given that the case involved serious allegations and multiple agencies handling different aspects of the case could lead to inefficiencies or inconsistency "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8b46e4832c384d718a0d0a04b11b7e67_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Therefore, the investigation should not be fragmented between different agencies."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "777d195581b9400cb075cfdc2a06b552_74",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nHanding over the investigation to the CBI ensures consistency."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a0befaf3687848bbaa55712de87fef35_75",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "17. The Special Investigation Team (SIT) is directed to hand over the Case Diary, other records,\nCCTV footages, statements, if any and all material and matters concerning the case to the C.B.I. by 10:00 A.M. tomorrow i.e. 24th August, 2024."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1c32a0165ad84ede892fee7a4c7a7458_76",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Apart from that any other information, which is relevant to the case as may be called for by the C.B.I. shall be provided by the Special Investigation Team (SIT)."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f30337851dcc421cad461d12382688e2_77",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAkhtar Ali vs The State Of West Bengal & Ors on 23 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/68121809/\n6"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a2f63eb2c0bc4eab93786562977f848e_78",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In Re: CAN 1 of 2024 18."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "85dddd4f2eb74417833f5d061b2276bf_81",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "19. However, the Supreme Court in Mumbai International Airport Private Limited v. Regency Convention Centre and Hotels Private Limited and Others reported in (2010) 7 SCC 417 held that:\n15."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1230cc2d2a6a47fe8afca15bcd819d39_82",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A \"necessary party\" is a person who ought to have been joined as a party and in whose absence no effective decree could be passed at all by the court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2a3077791fea438b8c2cfdac0aa3651b_83",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If a \"necessary party\" is not impleaded, the suit itself is liable to be dismissed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6301699c955242d6a062173bd3a0dec2_84",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A \"proper party\" is a party who, though not a necessary party, is a person whose presence would enable the court to completely, effectively and adequately adjudicate upon all matters in dispute in the suit, though he need not be a person in"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4d0c9632761949a7a39ec1ceaa7fe082_85",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "If a person is not found to be a proper or necessary party, the court has no jurisdiction to implead him, against the wishes of the plaintiff."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c9ce7098076e40baa6533ae260838735_86",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The fact that a person is likely to secure a right/interest in a suit property, after the suit is decided against the plaintiff, will not make such person a necessary party or a proper party to the suit for specific performance."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5c486d07fb634ce096be3105318f31ca_87",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Thus, it can be observed that a \"necessary party\" is an individual who must be joined as a party to the case and without whose presence; this court cannot pass a valid order."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e49f4dd9a8e549239ccef6fbaa45add2_88",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It has been determined that if a \"necessary party\" is not included, the entire lawsuit is susceptible to dismissal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3ea5fc0362664b0fa2991f4dab268cf9_89",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "20. However, in the present case, the applicant can neither be considered as a necessary nor a proper party, as a logical/effective conclusion can be reached at in the present writ petition without the inclusion of the applicant as a party."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "10aa830f99eb482393d4935ee0e90a98_90",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Furthermore, it is crucial to highlight that a Writ Court,\n"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d3221c57a86640d396fd0e2ceeb0ec31_91",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "when addressing police inaction, is not empowered to examine the substantive merits of the case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4340408fa69e462c914a2d351fd2892d_92",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "21. Thus, as the applicant has no objection to the formation and investigation by the Special Investigation Team (SIT), the applicant cannot be added as a necessary party in this writ petition and the application being CAN 1 of 2024 is ther"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d01b02155d5d418ea447bcac48661e7a_93",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "22. Regarding personal protection of the petitioner, as on date, no grave situation has taken place that prompts for protection to the petitioner from the State."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "451b4afc6ad64b9a83a4d287ee83debd_94",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, if need arises, leave is granted to the petitioner to approach the competent authority for personal protection to the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5e964073d1a7428eb34cc9648395df80_95",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n23. The concerned officer of the Central Bureau of Investigation is requested to file progress report of the investigation before this Court within three weeks from date."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cd744894af224ee68840fdddf53bf14f_97",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Mr. Banerjee, learned Senior Standing Counsel for the State after passing of the order prays for the stay of operation of this order."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9e97a77eaf11495ca3b9bd8ed91a24d3_98",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Such prayer is considered and rejected."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8fd441c156cb45aebb13b736373ba932_99",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "26. All parties shall act on the server copy of this order duly downloaded from the official website of this Court."
    }
  ],
